  "area": "graph",
  "description": "The context file is generated from the ontology (every asc: term, typed) plus the prefixes and term definitions of every external vocabulary graph.jsonld uses, protected and sorted canonically; a term mapped to null would remove it and is never emitted; expanding and re-compacting graph.jsonld reproduces the bytes.",
  "expected": {
